<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">Meitei: Roman Script 1st Translation</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc1">PETER-NA I-ba Ahanba Chithi</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Peter</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt1">PETER-NA</para>
  <para style="mt2">I-ba Ahanba Chithi</para>
  <para style="imt1">Wahoudok</para>
  <para style="ip">1 Peter-gi chithi asi Pakhonchatpa Peter-na i-bani. Peter-na chithi asi mahak kanano amadi kanada i-bano haiba taklaga houdok-i. Chithi asi mahaknadi “Lamlanbasing” (1:1, 1:17, amasung 2:11) hainadi koujariba Christian-singgi maphamda i-bani. Chithi asibu pabasing adubu lamlanba haina kouduna kayarak yaobagi maramdi makhoina leibak kayagi maphamda chaikhaiduna leibagini. Chithi asi Paul-na Ephesia-ki misingda i-ba chithi aduga manaba maramna 1 Peter asi Ephesia i-raba matung chaorakna Christtana poklaba matung chahi 65 gi matungda i-ramba oiramgani haina mi kaya amana thajanei. Peter-nadi Babylon (5:13) haina mingthon piba Rome-dagi chithi asi i-bani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mahakna chithi asi i-bagi maram adu “Masi Tengban Mapugi achumba thoujal aduni haiba eina sakhi piri amadi nakhoibu pukning thougatli” (5:12) haina Peter-na hairi. 1 Peter 2:11–3:7, Ephesians 5:18–6:9, amadi Colossians 3:18–4:6 asising asigi marakta manaba kaya yaori. Hairiba saruk ahum asi imung manunggi mari amadi angam athousinggi makha ponbagi maramda paotak piri. Aroiba adu naksilakpa maramna Christian-sing awa anada khaangba kannaba pukningsu thougatli (4:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaopham Takpa</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Peter-na mahak masabu takchaba amadi pariba makhoibu kanano haibadu panba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Makhoi punna saruk yaminnariba aran-khubham adugidamak Tengban Mapubu thagatchaba aduga makhoigi punsigi wahanthok adu haiba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 1:3-2:10">1:3–2:10</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Mathangda taibangpanda thajabasingna karamna ningthina hinggani haiba takpa amadi mapuroiba amadi loinabi amasung minai amadi mapugi marakta leinaba marisinggi maramda haiba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 2:11-4:19">2:11–4:19</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Awa ana taba matamda kuina khaangba kannaba Peter-na makhoibu thougatpiba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Adudagi mahakna chithi asi loisinba <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5:12-14</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1"/>Jisu Christtagi pakhonchatpa ama oiriba Peter-na,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Pontus, Galatia, Cappadocia, Asia amadi Bithynia leibaksingda changjapham louduna ichai chaina leiriba Tengban Mapuna khandokpiraba misingsing, <verse eid="1PE 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2"/>Ipa Ibungo Tengban Mapugi hanna khangbiba adugi matung inna, Thawaigi sengdokpibagi thabak adugi mapanna, Jisu Christtagi yathang innaba amasung Ibungo mahakki eena chamthokpinaba khandokpirabasinggi maphamda:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Thoujal amasung ingthaba marang kaina nakhoigi oirasanu.<verse eid="1PE 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahingba asa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3"/>Eikhoigi Mapu Ibungo Jisu Christtagi Mapa Ibungo amasung Tengban Mapubu thagatpa oisanu! Mahakki thoihenba chanbibagi matung inna Jisu Christtabu asibasinggi maraktagi hinggat-hanbagi mapanna ahingba asa amada mahakna eikhoibu amuk hanna pokpire, <verse eid="1PE 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4"/>aduga mangba nairoidaba, amakpa leitraba amasung patthaba leitraba phangpham thokpa ama eikhoigidamak thambire. Masigi phangpham thokpa asi nakhoigidamak swargada thambi, <verse eid="1PE 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5"/>Aroiba matamda phongdoknaba thourang touraba aran-khubham adugidamak nakhoigi thajabagi mapanna Tengban Mapugi panggalna nakhoibu ngaktuna thambi.<verse eid="1PE 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6"/>Matam kharagi oina nakhoina makhal kayagi chang yengbada awaba khaangba tarabasu, nakhoina masigidamak haraojou. <verse eid="1PE 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7"/>Chang yengbasing lakpagi maramdi nakhoigi thajaba adu tasengbani haiba utnanabani. Mangba yaba sana phaoba meida chang yeng-i; sanadagi mamal yamna hellaba nakhoigi thajaba adu khangnanaba chang yengba tabani. Madu oirabadi Jisu Christtabu phongdokpa Numit aduda thagatpa, matik mangal amasung ikai khumnaba nakhoina phangjagani. <verse eid="1PE 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8"/>Ibungo mahakpu uhoudrabasu nakhoina mahakpu nungsi; nakhoina mahakpu udrabasu, nakhoina Ibungo mahakpu thajei. Maram aduna waheina phongdokpa ngamdaba matik mangalna thallaba haraoba aduda nakhoina harao-i. <verse eid="1PE 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9"/>Maramdi nakhoigi thajabagi poloigi mahei, haibadi nakhoigi thawaigi aran-khubham adu nakhoina phangjari.<verse eid="1PE 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10"/>Aran-khubham asigi maramda Tengban Mapugi wa phongdokpasingna cheksinna thirammi amadi kupna yengsillammi aduga makhoina nakhoida pibigadaba khudol asigi maramda wa phongdoklammi. <verse eid="1PE 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11"/>Karamba matamda amadi karamna oigadouribano haiba makhoina khangnaba hotnarammi. Matam adudani makhoigi nungda leiba Christtagi Thawai aduna Christtana awa khanggadaba amasung madugi matungda matik mangal phanggadaba adugi maramda makhoida haibi. <verse eid="1PE 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12"/>Makhoina masa mathantagidamak nattaduna eikhoigidamak thougal touriba makhoida phongdokpirammi. Waramsing asi swargadagi thabirakpa Thawai Asengbana Aphaba Pao sandokpasinggi mapanna nakhoida phongdokpire. Waramsing asigi maramda swargadutsingna phaoba yengninglammi.<verse eid="1PE 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Asengba punsi ama hingnaba koubiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13"/>Maram aduna nakhoigi pukning semsaduna leiyu. Mitsing nasing-u aduga Jisu Christtana lenglakpa matamda nakhoida pubirakkadaba yaipha thoujal aduda mapung phana asa thammu. <verse eid="1PE 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14"/>Haiba inba angangsinggumna, nakhoina khangdringeida leiramba hannagi apambasing aduda sakwong louganu. <verse eid="1PE 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15"/>Madugi mahutta nakhoibu koubiba Ibungo mahakna sengbagumna nakhoisu nachat natou pumnamakta asengba oiyu. <verse eid="1PE 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44">Levi 11:44</ref>,<ref loc="LEV 11:45">45</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:2">19:2</ref></char></note>Mapugi puyana asumna hai, “Ei asengba oiba maramna nakhoi asengba oiyu.”<verse eid="1PE 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17"/>Misak mimai yengdana mi pumnamakpu mana mana touba thabakki matung inna wayenbiba mahakpu nakhoina Ipa haina kourabadi, malem asida nakhoina lamlanba amagumna Ibungobu ikai khumnana kina hing-u. <verse eid="1PE 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18"/>Nakhoigi ipa ipusingdagi thangtharakpa kannadaba punsi mahing adudagi nakhoibu thadokpinaba pikhiba mamal adu nakhoina khang-i. Madu mangba yaba sana nattraga lupana natte; <verse eid="1PE 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19"/>madu asoiba nattraga amakpa leitaba yao machagumlaba Christtagi mamal yamlaba ee adunani, <verse eid="1PE 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20"/>Ibungo mahakti taibangpan leisemdringeigi mamangda Tengban Mapuna khanbikhrabani, adubu aroiba numitsing asida nakhoigidamak phongdokpire. <verse eid="1PE 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21"/>Ibungobu asibasinggi maraktagi hinggat-hanbiduna matik mangal chaohankhiba Tengban Mapubu nakhoina Ibungo mahakki mapanna thajei, maduna nakhoigi thajaba amasung asa Tengban Mapugi maphamda thamjare.<verse eid="1PE 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22"/>Houjikti nakhoina achumba adu inbagi mapanna nakhoi nasabu sengdokchare maram aduna thajaba nachin nanaosingbu nakhoina pukchel sengna nungsire, thamoi pumnamak yaona amaga amaga pukning changna nungsinou. <verse eid="1PE 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23"/>Maramdi mangba yaba marudagi nattaduna mangba yadaba marudagi hingba amasung matam pumbada lengdana leiba Tengban Mapugi waheigi mapanna nakhoibu amuk hanna pokpire. <verse eid="1PE 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:24,25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa 40:6-8</ref> (LXX)</char></note> Mapugi puyana asumna hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Mioiba pumnamak napiga pangkhakni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 1:24">amasung makhoigi matik mangal pumnamak napigi mapal-gumbani.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Napina khuithei amasung mapalna kelli,<verse eid="1PE 1:24"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25"/>adubu Mapu Ibungogi waheidi matam pumnamakta lengdana lei.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Nakhoida sandokpa Aphaba Pao adu wahei asini.<verse eid="1PE 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Ahingba nung amasung asengba phurup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1"/>Phattaba touba pamba wakhal pumnamak amadi namthak pumnamak, aphasasinnaba, kalakpa amadi mi mangba yaba wangang pumnamak thadok-u. <verse eid="1PE 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2"/>Pokpa kuidriba anganggumna asengba thawaigi sanggom adu khourangna pamjou, madu thakchabagi mapanna nakhoibu chaokhat-hanbiduna kanbiba phangnanabani, <verse eid="1PE 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Isei 34:8</ref></char></note> houjikti nakhoina Mapu Ibungodi aphabani haiba adu mahao tangle.<verse eid="1PE 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4"/>Misingnadi kanadre haiduna hundoklaba adubu Tengban Mapunadi mamal leiba oina khan-gatlaba ahingba nung oiriba Mapu Ibungogi maphamda lak-u. <verse eid="1PE 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5"/>Nakhoisu ahingba nungsinggumna lak-u, aduga thawaigi oiba yum sagatpada nakhoibu sijinnahallu, mapham aduda nakhoina asengba purohit ama oina Jisu Christtagi mapanna Tengban Mapugi maphamda lousinba yaba thawaigi oiba iratpotsing katnanaba thougal tougani. <verse eid="1PE 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref> </char></note> Maramdi Mapugi puyana asumna hai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">“Eina khan-gatlab mamal yamlaba nung,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">chithekki nung adu eina Zion-da thamle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">amasung mahakpu thajaba kana amata ikaiba khak nangloi.”<verse eid="1PE 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Isei 118:22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Maram aduna thajaraba nakhoidadi mahak asi mamal yambani, adubu thajadabasinggidamaktadi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Yumsabasingna kanadre haiduna hundoklaba nung adu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">pumnamaktagi khwaidagi maruoiba oirakle.”<verse eid="1PE 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14">Isa 8:14</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 8:15">15</ref></char>
    </note>Aduga atoppa mapham amada Mapugi puyada asumna hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Misingbu khudi thihan-gadaba nung adu asini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">makhoibu tuhan-gadaba nungjao aduni.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Makhoina paojel adu haiba indabadagi khudi thibani; madusu makhoigidamak tamlakpa oire.<verse eid="1PE 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Khong 19:5</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 19:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:20">Isa 43:20</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 19:5">Khong 19:5</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:20">Aniwa 4:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 7:6">7:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14:2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:21">Isa 43:21</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Isa 9:2</ref></char>
    </note>Adubu nakhoibu amambadagi Ibungo mahak masamakki angakpa mangalda koubiba Tengban Mapugi angakpa thabaksingbu laothoknaba khan-gatpiraba, khandoklaba kanglup, Ningthougi oiba purohit, asengba phurupni. <verse eid="1PE 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref></char></note>Matam amadadi nakhoi Tengban Mapugi mising oiramde, adubu houjikti nakhoi mahakki mising oire; matam amadadi nakhoi Tengban Mapugi chanbiba phanglamde, adubu houjikti nakhoi Ibungo mahakki chanbiba phangle.<verse eid="1PE 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi manaising</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11"/>Achanbasa, nakhoi mireibak machasing amasung lamlanbasinggumna eina nakhoida nonjari adudi nakhoigi thawaigi mathakta lan sokliba hakchanggi apambasing adudagi lapthokna leiyu. <verse eid="1PE 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12"/>Thajadabasinggi mamangda nakhoigi phajaba lamchat chatlu, adu oirabadi makhoina nakhoibu phattaba tou-i haina maral sirabasu, Ibungona lengbirakpa Numit aduda makhoina nakhoigi aphaba thabaksing adu uduna Tengban Mapubu thagatkani.<verse eid="1PE 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13"/>Mapu Ibungogi maramgidamak angam athou oiba misinggi makha pollu: khwaigi mapu oiriba ningthourenda oirabasu, <verse eid="1PE 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14"/>nattraga aranba toubasingbu cheirak pinaba amasung achumba toubasingbu thagatnaba mahakna tharakpa leingak mapusing oirabasu makhoigi makha pollu. <verse eid="1PE 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15"/>Maramdi nakhoina aphaba touduna apangba misinggi khangdana pangangda ngangganba adu tuminna leihanba haibasi Tengban Mapugi aningbani. <verse eid="1PE 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16"/>Ningtamba misinggumna leiyu; adumakpu nakhoigi naning tamba aduna phattaba kupsinbada sijinnaganu, adubu Tengban Mapugi manaisinggumna hing-u. <verse eid="1PE 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17"/>Mi pumnamakpu ikai khumnou, thajaba nachin-nanaosingbu nungsiyu, Tengban Mapubu kiyu, Ningthourenbu ikai khumnou.<verse eid="1PE 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christtagi awa anana khudam oiba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18"/>Manaisa, ikai khumnabaga loinana Tengban Mapubu kibagi maramna nakhoigi mapusinggi makha pollu, aphaba amasung pukning tappasinggi makha ponba khakta nattaduna thina touba makhoising adugisu makha pollu. <verse eid="1PE 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19"/>Maramdi Tengban Mapugi aningba khangbagi maramna khaangpham thoktaba awa cheina nakhoina khaanglabadi, adugidamak Tengban Mapuna nakhoibu yaipha thoujal pibigani. <verse eid="1PE 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20"/>Maramdi nakhoina aranba toubagidamak nakhoida phu cheiba adu khaanglabadi, maduda kanapham kari leibage? Adubu nakhoina aphaba toubagidamak awaba khaanglabadi, madugidamak Tengban Mapuna nakhoibu yaipha thoujal pibigani. <verse eid="1PE 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21"/>Masi phaoba Tengban Mapuna nakhoibu koubire, maramdi Christtana masamkpu nakhoigidamakta awaba khaangduna nakhoina mahakki khonggul linanaba nakhoigidamak pandam thambire, <verse eid="1PE 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53:9</ref></char></note>Mahakti pap amata toukhide amasung mahakki chindagi oidaba amata takhide. <verse eid="1PE 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref></char></note>Mahakpu ikaiba piba matamda, mahakna ikaiba piduna paokhum hankhide; mahakna awaba khaangbada, mahakna makhoibu kihankhide, adubu chumna wayenba Mapu oiriba Tengban Mapugi maphamda mahak masabu sinajakhi. <verse eid="1PE 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24,25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 53:6">6</ref> </char></note>Eikhoina papta siraga achumba chatnabagidamak hingnaba, Christta masamakna cross mathakta mahakki hakchangda eikhoigi papsingbu pubire. Mahakki cheiphamsing aduna nakhoibu naba phahanbire. <verse eid="1PE 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25"/>Maramdi nakhoi lammuknaraba yaogum oirammi, adubu houjikti nakhoi Yaosenba amadi nakhoigi thawaibu Yengsinbiba mapugi maphamda hallakle.<verse eid="1PE 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Mapuroiba amasung loinabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Eph 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:18">Col 3:18</ref></char>
    </note>Matou asumna, yum pallabi nupi oibisa, nakhoi nakhoigi napuroibasinggi makha pollu, adu oirabadi Tengban Mapugi waheibu thajadaba kanagumba mapuroiba leirabadi, wahei amata hairuba toudana nakhoigi nachat natouna makhoibu thajahanba ngamgani, <verse eid="1PE 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2"/>maramdi nakhoina Tengban Mapubu kibaga loinana asengba lamchat chatpa adu makhoina ugani. <verse eid="1PE 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:9">1 Tim 2:9</ref></char></note>Nakhoigi leitengda mapanthonggi oiba haibadi sam lonba, nattraga sana lupa siba nattraga phijet leitengna oihan-ganu. <verse eid="1PE 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4"/>Madugi mahutta nakhoigi thammoi nunggi oiba phajaba, pukning tappa amasung pukning ingbagi mangba leitaba phajaba aduna leiteng-u, masi Tengban Mapugi mityengda yamna mamal yambani. <verse eid="1PE 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5"/>Maramdi mamangngeida Tengban Mapuda makhoigi asa thamjabi asengbi nupisingnasu makhoigi mapuroibagi makha ponna leiduna makhoi masabu leitengjarammi. <verse eid="1PE 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 18:12">Khong 18:12</ref></char></note>Sarah-su adugumba ama oirammi; mahakna Abraham-gi haiba induna mahakpu Ibungo haina koujarammi. Nakhoina aphaba touraba amadi karigumba amatabu kidrabadi, nakhoi mahakki machanupising oire.<verse eid="1PE 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Eph 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="COL 3:19">Col 3:19</ref></char>
    </note>Mapuroibasa, matou asumna nakhoigi nupisingga wakhal taminnana panminnou, makhoidi henna sonba mapang ama oina amadi nahakka punna hingbagi Tengban Mapugi khudol phangminnagadaba ama oina makhoibu ikai khumnou, madu oirabadi karigumba amatana nakhoigi haijabada apanba oihalloi.<verse eid="1PE 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Achumba toubagi awa khaangba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8"/>Aroiba oina, nakhoi pumnamak pukning amata oiyu, nungsibibagi wakhal thammu, amaga amaga nungsinou, minungsi leiyu amadi nolukpa oiyu. <verse eid="1PE 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9"/>Phattabagidamak phattaba han-ganu, ikaiba pibagidamak hanna ikaiba piganu. Madugi mahutta phattabagidamak bor oina hallu, maramdi nakhoina bor phangnabagidamak nakhoibu masigidamak koubire. <verse eid="1PE 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Isei 34:12-16</ref> </char></note>Mapugi puyana asumna hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Punsibu nungsiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">amasung aphaba numitpu uba pamba makhoi aduna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">makhoina phattaba ngangba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">amasung oidaba ngangba tokkadabani.<verse eid="1PE 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11"/>Makhoina phattabadagi leithoklaktuna aphaba tougadabani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">nakhoina ingthaba thiduna madu tanagadabani.<verse eid="1PE 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12"/>Maramdi MAPU IBUNGO-gi mit achumba chatpasinggi mathakta yengduna lei</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">aduga makhoina haijaba adu tabi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">adubu Mapu Ibungogi maithongdi phattaba toubasinggi maiyokta lei.”<verse eid="1PE 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13"/>Nakhoina aphaba tounabagidamak khouranglabadi, kanana nakhoida mangnaba tougadouribano? <verse eid="1PE 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14,15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mat 5:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:12">Isa 8:12</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 8:13">13</ref></char></note>Adubu nakhoina aphaba toubagidamak awa khaanglabadi nakhoi yaiphabani. Kanabusu kiganu amasung pukning waganu. <verse eid="1PE 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15"/>Adubu nakhoigi thamoi nungda Christtabu Mapu Ibungoni haina ikai khumnou. Nakhoida leiriba asa adugi maramda kanagumbana nakhoida hanglabadi, paokhum pinaba matam pumnamakta thourang touduna leiyu. Adubu pukning tappa amasung ikai khumnabaga loinana tou, <verse eid="1PE 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16"/>aphaba achum aran khangba pukning adu sengna thammu, adu oirabadi Christtada leiba nakhoigi aphaba nachat natou adubu phattana ngangliba makhoi aduna nakhoigi mangnaba ngangba adugidamak ikaijagani. <verse eid="1PE 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17"/>Maramdi masi Tengban Mapugi aningba oirabadi, aphaba toubagi awaba khaangbana phattaba toubagi awaba khaangbadagi henna phei. <verse eid="1PE 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18"/>Maramdi Christtana papkidamak amuktang sibikhre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">awaba khaangbikhre</char></note>, achumba chatpa mahakna achumba chattabasinggi mahutta, madu nakhoibu Tengban Mapugi maphamda pubinabani. Mahak hakchangda hatkhibani adubu Thawaida hinghanbire, <verse eid="1PE 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19"/>Hinggat-hallaba matungda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">adubu thawaida hinggat-hanba</char></note> mahakna keisumsangda leiba thawaisinggi manakta chattuna laothoklammi. <verse eid="1PE 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:1-7:24">Khong 6:1–7:24</ref></char></note>Makhoising adu mamangngeida Noah-gi haktakta hijao adu sagatlingeida Tengban Mapugi kuina khaangbiba aduna ngaibiramba matamda haiba inkhidaba thawaising aduni. Hi adugi manungda mi kharatabu, haibadi punna mi nipan isingdagi kanbikhi, <verse eid="1PE 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21"/>ising asi houjik nakhoibusu kanbiba Baptize touba adugi pandamni. Madu hakchangdagi amotpa louthokpa natte adubu Tengban Mapugi maphamda asengba achum aran khangba pukningdagi pijaba wasakni. Jisu Christtana sibadagi hinggatkhibagi maram aduna nakhoibu kanbibani, <verse eid="1PE 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22"/>Ibungo mahakti swargada lengkhattuna Tengban Mapugi yetthangbada leiri, swargadutsing, angambasing amasung panggalabasingna mahakki makha ponduna lei.<verse eid="1PE 3:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugidamak hingba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1"/>Maram aduna Christtana hakchangda awaba khaangbikhiba maramna nakhoi nasamaksu maduga mannaba pukning leiduna sem sajou; maramdi hakchangda awaba khaangba mahak aduna papka amuk mari leinadre. <verse eid="1PE 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2"/>Aduna nahakna nahakki leihouriba taibangpan-gi punsi adu mioibagi hakchanggi apambasing aduda nattaduna Tengban Mapugi aningbagi matung inna hingba punsi ama oigadabani. <verse eid="1PE 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3"/>Maramdi houkhraba matam amada Tengban Mapu ningdaba misingna touba pambasing haibadi lamchat kamba, mihouba, yu ngaoba, thak chaduna nungaithokpa, yu thaktuna makhe langba amasung tukkachaningngai oiraba lai murti latpa asising asi touduna matam marang kaina lenkhre. <verse eid="1PE 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4"/>Makhoina thaoidaba, ka henba punsi mahingda hingba asida nakhoina yaosindaba asida makhoina ngakladu nakhoibu thina ngang-i. <verse eid="1PE 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5"/>Adubu hingliba amasung asibasingbu wayennaba thourang touduna leiriba Ibungo mangonda makhoina toubasing adugi maram pikhigani. <verse eid="1PE 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6"/>Maram aduna asibasingdasu Aphaba Pao sandokkhi, makhoigi hakchanggi punsida mipum khudingmakta wayenbagumna wayenkhi; makhoigi thawaigi oiba punsida Tengban Mapuna hingbagumna hingnanaba makhoida sandokpani.<verse eid="1PE 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi khudolbu ningthijana sillangbasing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7"/>Pot pumnamak loigadaba adu naksille. Maram aduna nakhoina haijaba yananaba mitsing nasingna amadi pukning laksinna leiyu. <verse eid="1PE 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Pao 10:12</ref></char></note>Pumnamakki mathakta, nakhoi nasel amaga amaga chetna nungsinou maramdi nungsibana pap mayam amabu kupsilli. <verse eid="1PE 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9"/>Murum murum sonba yaodana amaga amaga yumda taramna oktuna pija pithak tounou. <verse eid="1PE 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10"/>Tengban Mapugi makhal makha kayagi khudolsingbu ningthina sillangba ama oina Tengban Mapudagi phangjaba toptoppa khudol adu nakhoi amamamna misinggi phananabagidamak sijinnagadabani. <verse eid="1PE 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11"/>Kanagumba amana wa nganglabadi, makhoina Tengban Mapugi wa ngangba amagumna nganggadabani; kanagumba amana thougal tourabadi, Tengban Mapuna pibiba panggalga loinana makhoina thougal tougadabani, masina Tengban Mapubu maram khudingmakta Jisu Christtagi mapanna thagatnabani. Matik mangal amasung panggal lomba naidana Ibungo mahakkini. Amen.<verse eid="1PE 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Christian oibagi maramda awa khaangba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12"/>Achanbasa, nakhoigi nathakta awabagi changyeng lakpa aduda karigumba mahousaga mannadabagumba ama thoklibani haina ngakkanu. <verse eid="1PE 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13"/>Adubu nakhoina Christtagi awaba khaangbagi saruk phangminnabani haina haraojou, maduna Ibungo mahakki matik mangal phongdokpa matamda nakhoi haraobana thannanabani. <verse eid="1PE 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14"/>Christtagi minggidamak misingna nakhoibu ikaiba pirabadi nakhoi yaiphabani, maramdi matik mangalgi amadi Tengban Mapugi Thawaina nakhoigi nathakta leibire. <verse eid="1PE 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15"/>Adubu karigumba nakhoina awaba khaangba tarabadi, madu mihatpa, nattraga huranba, nattraga karigumba atoppa makhal amagi maral leiraba, nattraga mathou nattana migi thabakta khut thingjinba mi amagumna oiroidabani. <verse eid="1PE 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16"/>Adumakpu nakhoina Christian ama oina awaba khaanglabadi maduda nahak ikaiganu, adubu nahakna Christtagi mingbu pujabagidamak nakhoina Tengban Mapubu thagatchou.<verse eid="1PE 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17"/>Tengban Mapugi imungdagi wayenba houbagi matam adu youre; wayenba asi eikhoidagi hanna hourabadi, Tengban Mapugi Aphaba Pao indaba makhoigi poloi adu kari oigani? <verse eid="1PE 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Pao 11:31</ref> </char></note>Asumna Mapugi puyana hai,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Achumba chatpa mibu wana kanbirabadi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">Tengban Mapu ningdaba amasung pap chenbasingdi kari oigani?”<verse eid="1PE 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19"/>Maram aduna Tengban Mapugi aningba matung inna awaba khaangba makhoina makhoi masabu thajaba yaba Sembiba Mapuda sinnajaduna aphaba thabak touduna leigadabani.<verse eid="1PE 4:19"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Tengban Mapugi yao sanggu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1"/>Nakhoigi narakta leiba ahal-lamansing, ahal ama oiriba amadi Christtana awaba khaangbagi sakhi ama oiriba aduga phongdokpigadaba matik mangal aduda saruk phanggadaba ama oina eina nakhoida haijari; <verse eid="1PE 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Jn 21:15-17</ref></char></note>nakhoigi nakhada leiba Tengban Mapugi yao sanggu adubu senbiyu, yengsinbiyu, tangaiphadana touba nattaduna Tengban Mapuna nakhoibu oihanningba adugumna, touningna tou; madu pukchel sengdana tongjanaba hotnaba nattaduna, touningna thougal tou. <verse eid="1PE 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3"/>Nakhoida sinnakhrabasing adugi mathakta mapu oina panba nattaduna yao sanggu aduda pandamsing oiyu. <verse eid="1PE 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4"/>Athoiba Yaosenba adu uhanbiba matamda, nakhoina sithaba leitraba matik mangalgi luhup adu phanggani.<verse eid="1PE 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:34">Pao 3:34</ref> </char>
    </note>Adugumduna nakhoi naha oibasa, nakhoi ahalsinggi makha pollu. Nakhoi pumnamak amaga amagagi maphamda nolukpagi phijol setlu, maramdi “Tengban Mapuna chaothokpasingbu thing-i, adubu nolukpasingda thoujal pibi.” <verse eid="1PE 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Luk 14:11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">18:14</ref></char></note>Maram aduna Tengban Mapugi panggalaba khutki makhada nakhoina nolukchou adu oirabadi Ibungo mahakki achaba matamda nakhoibu mahakna thanggatpigani <verse eid="1PE 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7"/>Nakhoigi langtaknaba pumnamak Ibungogi maphamda langsillu; maramdi mahakna nakhoigidamak khanbi.<verse eid="1PE 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8"/>Mit na singna leiyu amasung mitseng khang-u! Nakhoigi yeknaba Devil-na ngangliba nongsagumna kanagumbabu yotsinnaba thiduna koina chatli. <verse eid="1PE 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9"/>Nakhoigi thajabada chetna leppu amadi mahakpu thing-u, maramdi taibangpan-gi mapham pumnamakta leiba thajaba makhoidasu asigumba awaba khaangli haiba nakhoina khang-i. <verse eid="1PE 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10"/>Adubu nakhoina matam khara awaba khaanglaba matungda thoujal pumnamakki Tengban Mapuna mahakki lomba naidaba matik mangalda Christta Jisugi mapanna eikhoibu koubiraba Ibungo mahakna, nakhoibu mapung phahanbigani amasung achetpa, panggal amadi lengdraba yumpham nakhoida pibigani. <verse eid="1PE 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11"/>Matam pumbagi oina panggal adu Ibungo mangonda leiba oisanu! Amen.<verse eid="1PE 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Aroibagi khurumjaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:22">Pakhon 15:22</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 15:40">40</ref></char>
    </note>Eina thajaba yaba ichil inao amani haina singthanajaba Silas-ki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nattraga “Silvanus”</char></note> mapanna eina nakhoida samlapna chithi asi i-bani. Eina nakhoibu pukning thougatpa amadi masi Tengban Mapugi achumba thoujal aduni haiba eigi sakhi piba adu eina pammi.<verse eid="1PE 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Pakhon 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Col 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phile 24</ref></char>
    </note>Nakhoiga loinana khandokminnarabi, Babylon-gi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rome-gi mahut sinduna sijinnaramba yai</char></note> singlup aduna nakhoibu khurumjabagi wa hairak-i, aduga eigi icha Mark-nasu nakhoibu khurumjari. <verse eid="1PE 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14"/>Nungsibagi chupnabaga loinana nakhoi amaga amaga khurumnou.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Christtada leiba nakhoi pumnamakta ingthaba leisanu.<verse eid="1PE 5:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5"/>
</usx>
